[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3 uid="uid://unitlabel3dscenefont"]

; The one variable: the `font` of a Label3D. The top label has none and draws Godot's default font. The
; middle label is a `FontVariation` with no `base_font` at embolden 0.6, which grows the glyphs and
; their outline ring by FreeType's embolden. The bottom label is an OpenType-CFF font file. Every
; label has an outline, so the ring shows how each font is stroked. No other golden gives a Label3D
; a font, so none shows a regression in it.

[ext_resource type="FontFile" path="res://fonts/montserrat-extra-bold.otf" id="1_font"]

